# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv
.venv*/
venv/

# Secrets — API keys for the asset providers (Freesound / Jamendo) live here.
# Never commit these; use .env.example for the variable names.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Manim / pipeline output
media/
*.pyc

# QA artefacts that are cheap to regenerate
**/_qa_frames/

# Topic projects are local content: `manimations new` scaffolds them under
# projects/<slug>/ and they stay on the author's machine.  The example projects
# committed before this rule (_template, dns, gdu, ipv6) are already tracked, and
# an ignore rule does not untrack anything — so they stay in the repository while
# new topics are kept out of it.  Publish one explicitly with
# `git add -f projects/<slug>` when it is worth sharing.
projects/

